で溺れて苦しんでいる姿をお願いしたいです…！！人生の最期のワンシーンをイメージしているため、全身血みどろぐちゃぐちゃぼろぼろでリョナグロ要素が多めですと嬉しいです。\nお洋服や構図、表情などはおまかせさせてください。\n\nskebを依頼するのが初めてな為、何か不備がございましたらすみません💦\nなにとぞよろしくお願いいたします🙇‍♀️\nだいすきです！これからもご活躍応援しております！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1e-77wxYsmVc2KPqSZf_wUv2q33bvakNK/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shiroikabegami/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f9cf5213/uploads/origins/160ecdb9-82bb-4a4f-9183-d0481841f912?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9870c2c4a544601ef2da14f689abbbe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f9cf5213/uploads/origins/160ecdb9-82bb-4a4f-9183-d0481841f912?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9870c2c4a544601ef2da14f689abbbe, https://si.imgix.net/f9cf5213/uploads/origins/160ecdb9-82bb-4a4f-9183-d0481841f912?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2ca75d58b1de5f3c7485805c7dea1f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f9cf5213/uploads/origins/160ecdb9-82bb-4a4f-9183-d0481841f912?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb7ebcae51a4633f708fd4c6e0d4c877 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello! I would like to request a drawing of a Vtuber persona. I really love the eerie feeling in your art and the gore in them!\n\nPUMPKA is a virtual pumpkin! She is partly a computer based artificial intelligence (from NOKIA 3310 phone) and partly a pumpkin plant. She loves Halloween and spooky things. PUMPKA likes to do tricks, scares and computer errors.\n\nI would love to see a really scary illustration of PUMPKA. As she's a pumpkin someone could be turning her into a pumpkin pie or she could be carving humans like they carve jack-o'-lanterns. She can be the victim, murderer or both! Showing blood and such is ok! You can have the artistic freedom!\n\nThere's two designs on the reference folder. Please pick the one you want to use or feel free to combine them. \n\nThe art can be used on SNS, Twitter, Twitch and YouTube with credit. Thank you for your consideration! ♡\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qoULUWBf6260kAXAshhnU7isV1Wv2tWW?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shiroikabegami/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/43a1d6a7/uploads/origins/acf4af4f-9180-4c6c-809f-7b39c2afba52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e1c1ec5970799bb3c8e699585151a46", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/43a1d6a7/uploads/origins/acf4af4f-9180-4c6c-809f-7b39c2afba52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e1c1ec5970799bb3c8e699585151a46, https://si.imgix.net/43a1d6a7/uploads/origins/acf4af4f-9180-4c6c-809f-7b39c2afba52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbbe23a2a4adca78a41d67520628fc24 2x, https://si.imgix.net/43a1d6a7/uploads/origins/acf4af4f-9180-4c6c-809f-7b39c2afba52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=889d74dfea263b9559ee48b877966cf7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "黒吉マンです\n僕の創作キャラのロコくんを描いて欲しいです....!!\nロコくんはタコが嫌いですが 召喚士をしていたらタコの悪魔を召喚してしまったのでいつもまとわりつかれている子です!!!\nネトネトしたのが嫌いなので\nそれを踏まえた上で構図はお任せします!!!!!\nよろしくお願いします!!!!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/pokopokotarou1/status/1522262960638349321?s=21&t=v9YGn4pHlPTEtCCG0Jq9TQ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shiroikabegami/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd007a6a/uploads/origins/2e9eb5bc-90a8-4254-858f-5a154fbc1d02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2ce7dc0f11d9fa131c441e5bc27d29b9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd007a6a/uploads/origins/2e9eb5bc-90a8-4254-858f-5a154fbc1d02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccent